# Repo-root .dockerignore.
#
# Only apps/ssh is containerized today (deployed to Fly.io — see
# apps/ssh/Dockerfile). Its build context is the whole monorepo root (it
# needs apps/main/content/site-content.json alongside apps/ssh/), so this
# file is scoped to be safe for every app in the repo, not just ssh:
# it strips build/dependency output that no Dockerfile needs and that would
# otherwise get tarred up into the build context on every `docker build` /
# `fly deploy`. apps/main and apps/photo deploy via Cloudflare Workers
# (wrangler), not Docker, so excluding their heavy static/ dirs here can't
# affect their deploys.

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the image; never needed from the host)
**/node_modules

# SvelteKit build output (apps/main, apps/photo, apps/hdr, apps/langtree)
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/.wrangler
**/.output
**/.vercel
**/.netlify

# VCS / editor
.git
.github
.vscode
.DS_Store

# Gallery/portfolio static assets — large, and not read by the ssh app
apps/*/static

# Repo-root scratch media that isn't part of any app's source (already
# git-ignored, but .dockerignore is independent — without this these get
# sent to the Docker daemon/remote builder on every build)
*.mp4
*.mov
*.pdf
design-refs
